OL,3,GNEWSAResidents left without water after
OL,4,Apipe bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been left without water
OL,7,Fafter a pipe burst on Tuesday, leaving
OL,8,Fbehind what one resident described as
OL,9,F"a lake".
OL,11,FSevern Trent has apologised to those
OL,12,Fexperiencing no supply, poor pressure
OL,13,For discoloured water in the GL50 area,
OL,14,Fwhich covers central parts of
OL,15,FCheltenham.
OL,17,FThe A40 London Road has been closed
OL,18,Ffrom where it meets Old Bath Road and
OL,19,FHales Road, to the A435 Cirencester
OL,20,FRoad, while Severn Trent said the
OL,21,Frepair was taking "a little longer than
OL,22,Ffirst anticipated".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
